//│     ∀β, γ. {δ ≤ (Int ⟹ {γ ≥ Int, β ≤ Int}) ∨ (Str ⟹ {γ ≥ Str, β ≤ Str}), β ≤ (Int ⟹ {γ ≥ Int, δ ≤ Int}) ∨ (Str ⟹ {γ ≥ Str, δ ≤ Str})} ⟹ δ → β → γ ≤ ⊤ → ⊤ → ⊤
//│       ∀γ. {δ ≤ (Int ⟹ {γ ≥ Int, ε ≤ Int}) ∨ (Str ⟹ {γ ≥ Str, ε ≤ Str}), ε ≤ (Int ⟹ {γ ≥ Int, δ ≤ Int}) ∨ (Str ⟹ {γ ≥ Str, δ ≤ Str})} ⟹ δ → ε → γ ≤ ⊤ → ⊤ → ⊤
//│         {δ ≤ (Int ⟹ {ζ ≥ Int, ε ≤ Int}) ∨ (Str ⟹ {ζ ≥ Str, ε ≤ Str}), ε ≤ (Int ⟹ {ζ ≥ Int, δ ≤ Int}) ∨ (Str ⟹ {ζ ≥ Str, δ ≤ Str})} ⟹ δ → ε → ζ ≤ ⊤ → ⊤ → ⊤
//│           {ε ≤ (Int ⟹ {ζ ≥ Int, δ ≤ Int}) ∨ (Str ⟹ {ζ ≥ Str, δ ≤ Str})} ⟹ δ → ε → ζ ≤ ⊤ → ⊤ → ⊤
